      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Grek grc">
               <pb n="R" /><lb n="x" rend="left-to-right" />-- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- -- <lb n="x+1" rend="left-to-right" />τῶι ἀδελφ<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ῶι χαίρειν</supplied>
               <lb n="x+2" rend="left-to-right" />καὶ ἐρρωμέ<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ωι εὐτυχεῖν· χάρ-</supplied>
               <lb n="x+3" rend="left-to-right" />τιον ἐπανα̣<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">γνόντες ̣ ̣ ̣-</supplied>
               <lb break="no" n="x+4" rend="left-to-right" />των των<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">- ca.11 -</supplied>
               <lb n="x+5" rend="left-to-right" />τ̣ω̣ν περὶ <supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">τῆς σῆς(?)</supplied> ἀ̣παντή- <lb break="no" n="x+6" rend="left-to-right" />σεως <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id331" type="title">τοῦ μεγίστο̣υ̣ θε̣ο̣ῦ̣</rs>
               <lb n="x+7" rend="left-to-right" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d116">Σαμανούφιος</persName> καὶ τῆς τοῦ <lb n="x+8" rend="left-to-right" />συγγενοῦς μεγάλως ἐχάρη- <lb break="no" n="x+9" rend="left-to-right" />μεν καὶ ἀπευχαριστήσα- <lb break="no" n="x+10" rend="left-to-right" />μεν τοῖς ἐνταῦθα θεοῖς· <lb n="x+11" rend="left-to-right" />χαρίζοι<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="omitted">ο</supplied> δʼ ἂν μάλιστα <lb n="x+12" rend="left-to-right" />τοῦ σώματος ἐπιμελ<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ό-</supplied>
               <lb break="no" n="x+13" rend="left-to-right" />μενος ἵνʼ ὑγιαίνοντα σὲ ἀσπασώ- <lb break="no" n="x+14" rend="left-to-right" />μεθα· ἔρρωνται οἱ ἐν οἴκωι <lb n="x+15" rend="left-to-right" />πάντες καὶ οἱ παρʼ ἡμῶν·<lb n="x+16" rend="left-to-right" />ἐπισκοποῦ δὲ καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p30525">Πετενεφώ- <lb break="no" n="x+17" rend="left-to-right" />την</persName> καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p30530">Τοτοῆν</persName> καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p30535">Ψενιμο̣ύ̣θη<supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="lost">ν</supplied></persName>
               <lb n="x+18" rend="left-to-right" />καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p30540">Παῶν</persName> καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p30545">Ὀννῶφριν</persName>
               <lb n="x+19" rend="left-to-right" />καὶ τοὺς ἄλλους· <lb n="x+20" rend="left-to-right" />ἔρρωσο (ἔτους) η Παχὼν κ̅α̅ </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="R" /><lb n="x" rend="left-to-right" />- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - <lb n="x+1" rend="left-to-right" />to his brother, [sends greetings] <lb n="x+2" rend="left-to-right" />[and hopes] that he fares well. <lb n="x+3" rend="left-to-right" />When we read the letter ---<lb break="no" n="x+4" rend="left-to-right" />--- <lb n="x+5" rend="left-to-right" />about your encounter <lb break="no" n="x+6" rend="left-to-right" />with the greatest god <lb n="x+7" rend="left-to-right" />Samanouphis and his <lb n="x+8" rend="left-to-right" />kin, we greately rejoiced <lb break="no" n="x+9" rend="left-to-right" />and we returned thanks <lb break="no" n="x+10" rend="left-to-right" />to the gods here. <lb n="x+11" rend="left-to-right" />You would do us a great favour <lb n="x+12" rend="left-to-right" />by taking care of your body<lb break="no" n="x+13" rend="left-to-right" />so that we may greet you in good health. <lb break="no" n="x+14" rend="left-to-right"
                   />The family members are all well <lb n="x+15" rend="left-to-right" />and also those with us.<lb n="x+16" rend="left-to-right" />Watch over Petenepho- <lb break="no" n="x+17" rend="left-to-right" />tes and Totoes and Psenimouthes <lb n="x+18" rend="left-to-right" />and Paos and Onnophris <lb n="x+19" rend="left-to-right" />and the others.<lb n="x+20" rend="left-to-right" />Farewell. Year 8, Pachon 21. </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
